  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_9e7933ed-3639-407d-8c87-6b81fc9fc7af.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_0aeee252-5d9a-40da-9e56-cef8515185e0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>📖 概述：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Jaam的武器库（Jaam's Weaponry）</strong> 是一款原版增强型战斗扩展模组，旨在极大地丰富玩家可用的玩法风格。该模组专注于扩展和完善《我的世界》的战斗系统，引入了大量新武器，每把武器都拥有独特的机制和行为，使每一次战斗都感觉截然不同且充满冲击力。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">该模组不仅引入了各种各样的新武器，还重新设计并增强了现有的原版武器库以及原版生物使用的装备。这些改进使得新旧武器在使用时更加协调、平衡且令人兴奋，贯穿游戏全程。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">它鼓励玩家掌握时机、移动和创造力，旨在让战斗更加沉浸、策略性和富有回报感。每种新武器的加入都允许玩家发展自己的战斗风格并适应新的挑战，为PvE和PvP遭遇战提供全新的应对方式。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_0cb5fd5f-0d74-4fd2-9a35-08c78694ddb7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_38e04065-fbd7-4641-88cd-6cf00d0de145.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">🎯 特性：</span></strong></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>+50 种新武器，包括分级武器、独特武器、远程武器和枪械。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>+50 种新武器能力和机制。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>新效果、附魔和进度。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>改进的原版敌对生物装备。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>原版战斗和武器改进。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>武器皮肤和彩蛋。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>专门的模组兼容性支持。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>高级工具提示系统。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>广泛的配置选项。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>以及更多！<br><br></strong>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_02c04868-e025-4347-9781-54f13849b8db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"531\" height=\"1422\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_38e04065-fbd7-4641-88cd-6cf00d0de145.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">🤝 兼容性：</span></strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Better Combat</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Epic Fight</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jaams-shinerite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Jaam's Shinerite</span></strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeper-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Deeper Caves</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/majruszs-progressive-difficulty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Majrusz's Progressive Difficulty</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Oreganized</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Farmer's Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Supplementaries</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_1f5561d7-82e1-4762-bc27-6e8084399953.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"226\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_38e04065-fbd7-4641-88cd-6cf00d0de145.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"32\"></span></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">⚙️ 推荐模组：</span></strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/model-gap-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Model Gap Fix</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Descriptions</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Effect Descriptions (JEED)</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/catalogue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Catalogue</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_d6331908-c758-4acc-acd4-2358f0a4a75c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"226\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_38e04065-fbd7-4641-88cd-6cf00d0de145.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"32\"></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">🚧 未来计划：</span></strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>主题更新及整合社区反馈。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>更多武器类型和战斗机制。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>与其他主要模组的扩展兼容性。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_7e131610-1274-4a1f-ae7d-0b325fb09bcd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"226\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_38e04065-fbd7-4641-88cd-6cf00d0de145.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"32\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ApZgFR7zZv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_d0080914-c424-44de-bfd7-fad93f8e271b.png\" alt=\"加入Discord！\" width=\"48\" height=\"51\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/Jaamleeto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_191bf896-1e0a-40c0-9886-7d36359da5af.png\" alt=\"支持我！\" width=\"48\" height=\"51\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/jaamleeto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_7e664771-4d97-4145-a228-7a0eff5777cf.png\" alt=\"GitHub！\" width=\"48\" height=\"51\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Jaamleeto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1361012/description_19266eaf-12e7-4074-a29d-7b3fe31b1482.png\" alt=\"YouTube！\" width=\"48\" height=\"51\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinkt